spice
*MOSFET Parameters
.model NMOS nmos
.model PMOS pmos

* NMOS Transistors
M8 4 5 4 4 NMOS W=100u L=8u
M9 3 3 6 6 NMOS W=100u L=8u
M11 2 5 3 3 NMOS W=100u L=8u
M12 2 2 6 6 NMOS W=100u L=8u

* PMOS Transistor
M10 4 5 5 5 PMOS W=100u L=8u

* Current Source
Is 4 6 DC 20uA

* Voltage Sources (for completeness)
Vdd 4 0 DC 5V
Vss 6 0 DC -5V

.end